OL,3,GNEWSAMan and daughter who dumped body
OL,4,Ain canal jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and his daughter, who disposed of
OL,7,Fa woman's body in a canal after he
OL,8,Fmurdered her in a "brutal" attack, have
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FChereiss Bailey was found dead in a
OL,12,Fcanal off Ryders Green Road in West
OL,13,FBromwich, West Midlands, in October
OL,14,Flast year.
OL,16,FJohn Anslow, 65, who claimed to be
OL,17,Fdisabled, assaulted the 36-year-old
OL,18,Fvictim at his home before he and
OL,19,FHayley-Marie Ferguson, 42, moved her
OL,20,Fbody in a wheelchair and used a washing
OL,21,Fline with paving slabs attached to
OL,22,Fsubmerge it in the water.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
